~ waking
Malakor: You wake. Good. Not all of them do. [ID:bck0morkntt2n_bd3fca]
Álvar: Elena. Where is she? [ID:bck0morkntt2n_b02d6f]
Malakor: The woman you guarded got away through the Tagus gate, and what she carried went with her. [ID:bck0morkntt2n_bb27fa]
Malakor: You did not. My people cut you down in the burning quarter. You died there, in the smoke, and I gave you my blood. That is the Turning. [ID:bck0morkntt2n_d18ac0]
Malakor: You belong to the Blood-Forged now. This forge is your house, and I am its master. [ID:bck0morkntt2n_61e814]
Malakor: Take this. Iron in the sinew, when you call on the Blood. The first of your Rites. [ID:bck0morkntt2n_d47144]
do learn("alvar", "iron_sinew")
do set_flag("met_malakor")
Malakor: Íñigo will tell you the rest. I do not say a thing twice. [ID:bck0morkntt2n_384a3f]
=> END

~ malakor
if has_flag("vault_cleared")
	Malakor: The first hall is quiet, then. The lock beneath it has outlasted kings. It will keep until I say. [ID:bck0morkntt2n_15bf17]
elif has_flag("order_given")
	Malakor: The stair is open. Go down. [ID:bck0morkntt2n_097122]
	if conscience() <= 4
		Malakor: You are becoming what I made you. Good. [ID:bck0morkntt2n_42d932]
	elif conscience() >= 8
		Malakor: You still pray at night, friar. I hear it through the stone. Pray below, if you must. [ID:bck0morkntt2n_486722]
elif has_flag("zahra_joined") and has_flag("gonzalo_joined") and has_flag("captive_done")
	Malakor: Under this city there are vaults older than its churches. [ID:bck0morkntt2n_b5c558]
	Malakor: Every king who held Toledo hung a lock on them. I want those locks broken. You will go down and break them. [ID:bck0morkntt2n_0e85f9]
	Malakor: Gonzalo knows the first stair. Zahra knows what bleeds. You go first. [ID:bck0morkntt2n_a4e6aa]
	Malakor: One thing more. You carried a letter for the translator. Give it to me. [ID:bck0morkntt2n_f677b5]
	- Hand it over [ID:bck0morkntt2n_9b76f1]
		do change_conscience(-1)
		do set_flag("gave_letter")
		do set_flag("order_given")
		Malakor: Good. She will not get far. [ID:bck0morkntt2n_b7bf92]
	- Say it burned in the quarter [ID:bck0morkntt2n_0ce0a8]
		do change_conscience(1)
		do set_flag("kept_letter")
		do set_flag("order_given")
		Malakor: Burned. Much burned that night. Remember that you told me so. [ID:bck0morkntt2n_21b71f]
	Malakor: The stair is open. Go. [ID:bck0morkntt2n_563a93]
else
	if not has_flag("zahra_joined") and not has_flag("gonzalo_joined")
		Malakor: You do not go below alone. Zahra and Gonzalo go with you. Find them. [ID:bck0morkntt2n_d95009]
	elif not has_flag("zahra_joined")
		Malakor: You do not go below without Zahra. Find her. [ID:bck0morkntt2n_665d76]
	elif not has_flag("gonzalo_joined")
		Malakor: You do not go below without Gonzalo. Find him. [ID:bck0morkntt2n_749bd7]
	if not has_flag("captive_done")
		if has_flag("zahra_joined") and has_flag("gonzalo_joined")
			Malakor: The prisoner is still yours. See to him before you go below. [ID:bck0morkntt2n_7feeb7]
		else
			Malakor: And see to the prisoner. He is yours. [ID:bck0morkntt2n_08f966]
=> END

~ smith
if has_flag("smith_heard")
	Íñigo: I said it once. When the Blood runs low, you drink. [ID:bck0morkntt2n_f4ee70]
	Íñigo: Let it run dry and the Fury chooses for you. Now mind the sparks. [ID:bck0morkntt2n_13acb0]
	=> END
if has_flag("captive_done")
	Íñigo: Stand clear of the quench. You have been to the alcove, I can see it on you. He told me to tell you how things are. [ID:bck0morkntt2n_ccc626]
else
	Íñigo: Stand there, out of the sparks. He told me to tell you how things are, and I have iron cooling. [ID:bck0morkntt2n_3adb7c]
Íñigo: The Blood in you is not your own now. Every Rite spends it. When it runs low you drink; let it run dry, and the Fury drinks for you. [ID:bck0morkntt2n_0f4adf]
Íñigo: And the Silence: the living above must never learn what walks beneath them. That is all. Hand me the tongs on your way out. [ID:bck0morkntt2n_868bec]
do set_flag("smith_heard")
=> END

~ captive
if not has_flag("captive_done")
	The captive: Stay back. I took the cross at Montpellier. I do not kneel to you. [ID:bck0morkntt2n_7934ba]
	The captive: You are the friar. I saw you fall at the gate. I saw them open your throat. [ID:bck0morkntt2n_efd635]
	The captive: My leg is broken, and I am thirsty, and I am not afraid of you. Do what you came for. [ID:bck0morkntt2n_cd80b8]
	- Drink a little [ID:bck0morkntt2n_24e725]
		do give_blood(30)
		do set_flag("captive_done")
		The captive: You stopped. Why did you stop? [ID:bck0morkntt2n_dfb00d]
	- Drain him [ID:bck0morkntt2n_a8df0b]
		do give_blood(100)
		do change_conscience(-2)
		do set_flag("captive_dead")
		do set_flag("captive_done")
		Álvar: The Blood is warm. He is not. [ID:bck0morkntt2n_afacd5]
	- Leave him be [ID:bck0morkntt2n_51df10]
		do change_conscience(1)
		do set_flag("captive_done")
		do set_flag("captive_spared")
		The captive: Go, then. Whatever you are, I will pray for you. I do not know to whom. [ID:bck0morkntt2n_4047ed]
elif has_flag("captive_spared")
	The captive: You again. You could have, and you did not. I think about that more than the leg. [ID:bck0morkntt2n_c58f81]
elif not has_flag("captive_dead")
	The captive: My arm still burns where you drank. Come no closer. [ID:bck0morkntt2n_ee06a9]
=> END

~ zahra
Zahra: So you are the friar from the gate. How does the Blood sit in you? Heavy, still? [ID:bck0morkntt2n_2c4e22]
Zahra: I was a physician in Córdoba before my Turning. I still look at the wound before the face. [ID:bck0morkntt2n_8505c0]
if has_flag("captive_dead")
	Zahra: The crusader in the alcove has gone quiet. Was that you? Was it hunger, or obedience? [ID:bck0morkntt2n_1b8d8a]
elif has_flag("captive_spared")
	Zahra: You left the crusader breathing. Was that mercy, or did you not know how? [ID:bck0morkntt2n_8f8c4f]
Zahra: Malakor wants you below. Has he told you what is down there? No. He never does. [ID:bck0morkntt2n_7b5359]
Zahra: Then I will come with you and see it for myself. Look at me. Look hard. [ID:bck0morkntt2n_01605a]
do join("zahra")
do set_flag("zahra_joined")
do learn("alvar", "baleful_eye")
Zahra: Do you feel it behind the eyes? Hold a man's gaze like that and he forgets how to move. [ID:bck0morkntt2n_4bb1cb]
Zahra: It costs Blood, like everything here. Who do you think pays for it in the end? [ID:bck0morkntt2n_6b4885]
=> END

~ gonzalo
Gonzalo: You are the new one. [ID:bck0morkntt2n_7f6011]
Gonzalo: I made blades in this cellar before your grandfather was born. I serve the Sangre. [ID:bck0morkntt2n_d88f3d]
Gonzalo: Zahra asks the questions. I carry the hammer. [ID:bck0morkntt2n_436635]
Gonzalo: Malakor says I go below with you. So I go. [ID:bck0morkntt2n_63e08a]
do join("gonzalo")
do set_flag("gonzalo_joined")
Gonzalo: Keep your blade low. Walk. [ID:bck0morkntt2n_e91e97]
=> END
